  "text": "Emergency Vet | Overland Park Veterinary Emergency and Specialty\nSkip to Primary Content\nMap\n8301 W 163rd St,\nOverland Park,\nKS,\n66223\nCall\n(913) 361-3800\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(913) 361-3800\nAddress:\n8301 W 163rd St,\nOverland Park,\nKS,\n66223\nView Our Mission Location\nRDVM Portal\nEvents\nBlog\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nCareers\nSpecialty Services\nAll Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nOncology\nPet Owners\nReferring Veterinarians\nReferring Veterinarians\nPatient Referral Form\nRDVM Portal\nContact Us\nEmergency\nExperiencing a pet emergency?\nContact us right away.\nAdvanced Surgical Care When it Matters Most\nPersonalized surgical plans with post-operative pain management for optimal recovery, available 24/7.\nLearn More\nNew TPLO Pricing\nTIBIAL PLATEAU LEVELING OSTEOTOMY\nNow Offering Flat-Rate TPLO Prices\n$200 Surgery Consultation\n$3,500 Unilateral TPLO (One Knee)\n$6,000 Bilateral TPLO (Same Surgery)\nLearn More\nWelcome to the Family\nat Overland Park Emergency & Specialty\nContact Us\nFriday Surgical Consultations are Now Available\nDr. Connor Pyne is now accepting surgical consultation appointments Tuesday through Friday, with new Friday availability for referred patients.\nSchedule a Surgery Consultation\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\nWe're always open to provide you with quality veterinary emergency, critical care, and specialty services.\nEmergency & Critical Care\nSpecialized Oncology Care Has Arrived\nWelcoming Dr. Katilee Jacobs and the addition of our oncology department. Now accepting appointments, services begin September 2, 2025.\nCall 913-361-3800 to Schedule\nComprehensive Internal Medicine for Pets\nSpecializing in the diagnostics and treatment of complex conditions affecting the Kidney, Liver, GI tract, and more.\nLearn More\nAdvanced Surgical Care When it Matters Most\nPersonalized surgical plans with post-operative pain management for optimal recovery, available 24/7.