Hours a Day\nThe skilled team at Overland Park Veterinary Emergency and Specialty provides around-the-clock veterinary specialty and emergency care to Overland Park, Leawood, Olathe, and the surrounding Kansas City area communities. After each visit, our specialists and emergency doctors communicate directly with your pet’s primary veterinarian to coordinate after-visit care.\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(913) 361-3800\nFax:\n(913) 361-3802\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nClient Testimonials & Reviews\nOur staff at Overland Park Veterinary Emergency and Specialty values feedback from our clients. Here is just a small sample of the hundreds of happy and healthy pets that we have cared for in the Overland Park community.\nOverland Park Veterinary Emergency and Specialty\n8301 W 163rd St\nOverland Park\n,\nKS\n66223\nT:\n(913) 361-3800\nF:\n(913) 361-3802\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nEmergency\nAbout Us\nSpecialty Services\nPet Owners\nReferring Veterinarians\nContact Us\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
